 but `verify-live` stopped with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'PIL'` when the V14 verifier imported the deterministic image validation code. This prevented the production browser acceptance stage from running.\n\n## Change\nInstall `pillow==11.2.1` in the `verify-live` Python 3.11 environment before HTTPS and semantic verification. This matches the existing build and recorded WebP conversion runtime. All existing checks, image review states, source data and homepage V12 remain intact.\n\n## Validation\nIn an isolated Python 3.11.18 process with site packages disabled and only the Pillow package/native libraries supplied, imported the complete V14 validation module and ran `validate_record()` against the actual source PNG and supporting assets. Pillow 11.2.1 / libwebp 1.5.0 matched the contract; full and mobile WebP bytes matched exactly. `git diff --check` passed.\n\nThe full PR and production workflows still must pass. This fixes the publication verification environment; V14 remains an explicitly rejected trial, and homepage replacement is not approved. Continues #84, #52 and #47.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T12:19:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:19:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b45630734b0e98a64f85ad659b0456a509a095b6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"mechgouki:fix/r12-live-verifier-runtime","ref":"fix/r12-live-verifier-runtime","repo":{"id":1452939438,"node_id":"R_kgDOVpoYrg","name":"luoyang-city","full_name":"mechgouki/luoyang-city","owner":{"login":"mechgouki","id":8364215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki","html_url":"https://github.com/mechgouki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechgouki/following{/other_